    ]
  },
  "key_sentences": [
    "I don't like fishing. I like reading.",
    "Do you like fishing? No, I don't.",
    "Does he like skateboarding? Yes, he does.",
    "My friends have lots of hobbies. They like playing computer games and watching DVDs.",
    "I love reading comics, too.",
